// The optional tones layer's named frequencies (docs/design/music.md, section 10): the "solfeggio"
// set, as data; any other frequency can be typed in Settings. Offered as a matter of taste: the app
// says only "Some people find these tones calming; there is no good evidence that they heal." These
// are not notes of the score's scale, so a tone plays only while the music is off.
Tones(named_hz: [174.0, 285.0, 396.0, 417.0, 528.0, 639.0, 741.0, 852.0, 963.0])
